AgentMax A2A layer
==================

The modules in this package (protocol.py, client.py, and server.py) are
adapted from the OpenJarvis project:

    OpenJarvis — https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis
    Copyright the OpenJarvis authors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Changes from the original include: renaming to the AgentMax namespace,
modernized type hints, decoupling the A2A server from the OpenJarvis EventBus
(now an optional on_event callback), and replacing the framework-bound
A2AAgentTool with the A2AManager registry bridge.
